This is README file for final project of Application of Deep Learning in Medical Imaging
Author: B07508008 陳郁翔 B07508009 李潔宜
Team: FinishByDL
Date:1/4
=====
SYNOPSIS:

train.py --data $datapath
inference.py --data $datapath
======
BEFORE YOU RUN:

Please run the download.sh file at the same directory as that of inference.py
or please download the checkpoint.pth file from the drive below,
put it in the same directory, and unzip it.
https://www.dropbox.com/s/34sdk2ddxvrtl65/checkpoint.zip
======
HOW TO RUN:

python inference.py --data $datapath
The prediction.csv file containing all predictions of testing queries will locate in $datapath/.
